WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.746
At eight years old, I was 
enrolled in dance class.

00:00:04.235 --> 00:00:07.138
And by ten, I informed my mother  

00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:10.000
that I didn't want to go 
to school anymore.

00:00:10.958 --> 00:00:13.902
I wanted to be like&nbsp;Billy Elliot 
and go to stage school.

00:00:14.362 --> 00:00:18.144
She would repeatedly ask me, "Are 
you sure this is what&nbsp;you want?"

00:00:18.144 --> 00:00:21.083
And to me, it was a no-brainer.

00:00:21.905 --> 00:00:25.746
At the time, I was just too young 
and naive to&nbsp;feel inadequate.

00:00:25.746 --> 00:00:27.930
If Billy Elliot could do it, so could I.

00:00:28.801 --> 00:00:34.259
Failing to land the part in the&nbsp;hit sequel
 "Nanny McPhee" to "The Big Bang,"

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.760
My second audition was for a&nbsp;
show called "Game of Thrones.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:44.384
I had a hard Bristolian accent and 
dark rings&nbsp;around my eyes

00:00:44.384 --> 00:00:46.878
that were so big they 
took up half my face.

00:00:47.436 --> 00:00:48.804
I was cheeky.

00:00:49.397 --> 00:00:50.754
I was loud.

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:52.989
I was angry.

00:00:53.763 --> 00:00:57.300
And for this, I was perfect.

